3. Adjusted the loop invariant in the `fuse` case to be more precise (`fused.Length <= 2 * j` instead of `fused.Length == 2 * j`).
4. The original code had a case for "gold" but it wasn't in the Operation datatype - I kept it since it seems to be used in the processing logic.

